The '''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an Optional Objective contained within a group of Terminid structures. For as long as they are standing, they will spawn [[Shrieker|Shriekers]]: flying [[Terminids]] that flock around the nest until a Helldiver draws near. The nests consist of two or three mushroom-like structures similar in shape to [[Spore Spewer|Spore Spewers]] which act as a spawn point for the Shriekers. To complete the Optional Objective, Helldivers must destroy the structures, after which the Shriekers will cease spawning.

== Objective Steps ==
* Destroy Shrieker Nest
* Reward: {{Currency|Requisition|200|notext}} & {{Currency|Experience|50|notext}}

== Anatomy ==
{{Anatomy Table|
  {{Anatomy Row
    | part_name = Main
    | health = 2,500
    | av = 2
	| front_image = Shrieker Nest Towers.png
    | durability = 100%
    | percent_to_main = -
    | bleed = None
    | fatal = Yes
    | exdr = 0%
  }}
}}

== Tactical Information ==
* The structure has {{Armor|2|AV}} Armor and can be destroyed by most [[Weapons]] or [[Stratagems]]. However, its 100% durable healthpool narrows the amount of primary weapons that can destroy it quickly and with minimal ammo usage.
* Shriekers will only spawn if there are Helldivers within 130 meters of the nest detected by the enemy. Helldivers may know the distance of a point by pinging it.
* Laser weapons such as [[LAS-5 Scythe]] or [[LAS-7 Dagger]] are capable of easily dispatching [[Shrieker|Shriekers]] when getting close to a Shrieker Nest, as the [[wp:Hitscan|hitscan]] nature of these weapons makes them ideal for consistently hitting and igniting agile fliers.
* It is advised to look up before calling a [[NUX-223 Hellbomb]] since the Hellpod might hit the top of the nest due to its mushroom-like nature and waste the opportunity to quickly complete the objective.
** While not recommended, three Hellpod impacts is enough to destroy one tower.
* Due to the dangerous nature of this structure, using a [[NUX-223 Hellbomb]] to destroy it is not recommended. Instead, engage it from outside of the Shrieker spawning range with weapons such as [[FAF-14 Spear]], [[GR-8 Recoilless Rifle]] or [[AC-8 Autocannon]] with FLAK rounds.
** Vehicles such as [[EXO-49 Emancipator Exosuit]] or [[TD-220 Bastion MK XVI|TD-220 Bastion]] are very effective against several Shrieker Nests in a single use.
*** A few shield bashes from [[EXO-55 Breakthrough Exosuit]] is enough to destoy one tower without consuming its flak cannon ammo.
** One [[E/MG-101 HMG Emplacement]] has enough ammo to deal with 3 towers with ammo to spare.
** The [[MGX-42 Bullet Storm]] can destroy a single tower at the cost of nearly its full magazine. The weapon's easily replaceable nature makes this strategy viable (if lengthy), but it's best used to finish off a tower that's already been damaged.
*** A single [[EAT-17 Expendable Anti-Tank|EAT-17]] and a few seconds of Bullet Storm fire will destroy a single tower, freeing the second EAT-17 from the same Hellpod to be used on a second tower.

== Gallery ==
<gallery>
Shrieker Nest.png|Some {{PAGENAME}}s
</gallery>

