The '''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an Optional Objective contained within an Automaton structure. For as long as it is standing, it will continuously spawn [[Gunship|Gunships]]. To complete the Objective, Helldivers must destroy the structure. 

== Objective Steps ==
* Find and destroy any active Automaton Gunship Fabricators
** Helldivers must approach the site, call down, arm and defend the [[Hellbomb]] until the structure is destroyed.
* Reward: {{Currency|Requisition Slips|200}} & {{Currency|Experience|50}}

== Tactical Information ==
* As long as a Helldiver remains within 150-meter radius, each operational Gunship Facility tower spawns up to two Gunships every 60-seconds up to a maximum of four active Gunships per tower.
* The Gunship Facility requires a demolition force of 60 to be destroyed.
** All Eagle and Orbital stratagems are ineffective and will not damage nor destroy Gunship Facilities.
** [[SEAF Artillery#Artillery Shells|SEAF Artillery: Mini Nuke]], [[B-100 Portable Hellbomb]] or [[NUX-223 Hellbomb]] can be used to destroy it.
*** Note that the Gunship Facility '''MUST''' be within the '''17 meter''' inner explosion radius to maximize demolition force as it falls-off in the outer radius.
*** With careful positioning, it is possible to destroy dual Gunship Facility sites with a singular Hellbomb as long as they are both within the 17 meter radius.

== Gallery ==
