'''Weapons''' can be equipped at the [[Armory]] or in a [[Hellpod]] on the [[Bridge]] before [[missions]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.
==Overview==
Weapons have different [[Damage#Damage Types|damage types]]. Most have [[recoil]].

==Acquisition==
Most personal weapons are unlocked through [[Warbonds]] using {{Currency|Medals}}, with some exceptions.<ref name=wpnexc />

Most [[#Support Weapons|support weapons]] are purchased through the [[Patriotic Administration Center#Ship Management|Ship Management]] with {{Currency|Requisition Slips}}, with some exceptions.<ref name=supexc />

